---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const brand = (await getCollection('brand'))[0].data;
---

<BaseLayout {brand} title="Proof Machine — AURA Direction 02" description="Concept direction: an evidence-first operator and consultant authority site." transparentHeader={false} bodyClass="direction direction--proof">
  <section class="pm-hero">
    <nav class="pm-nav"><a href="/directions/">AURA / DIRECTION 02</a><span>Proof machine</span><a href="/contact/">Start a project ↗</a></nav>
    <div class="pm-hero__copy"><p class="pm-label">A consultant site where the evidence leads</p><h1><span>3.1×</span><br />MORE<br /><i>BELIEF.</i></h1><p>For operators who are tired of reducing years of decisions to a two-line bio. The record is already there. The job is to make it legible.</p><a href="#receipts">See the receipts <b>↓</b></a></div>
    <div class="pm-hero__photo"><img src="/images/portrait-hero-insitu.webp" alt="Conceptual consultant in an executive working environment" width="1600" height="1000" /><span class="pm-photo-note">Real work. Clear signal.<br />No borrowed authority.</span></div>
    <aside class="pm-side">OUTCOME<br />IS THE<br />ASSET</aside>
  </section>

  <section id="receipts" class="pm-receipts"><div class="pm-receipts__intro"><p class="pm-label">The receipt wall</p><h2>Specificity does not need<br />a sales voice.</h2><p>Dense information becomes powerful when it is arranged like evidence. One metric. One decision. One clear implication.</p></div><div class="pm-receipts__grid"><article><b>$180M</b><h3>Capital raised</h3><p>After a founder thesis became a clear public point of view.</p><span>01 / CAPITAL</span></article><article><b>2</b><h3>Board invitations</h3><p>After the executive record became easy to forward and repeat.</p><span>02 / TRUST</span></article><article><b>14</b><h3>Qualified inbound conversations</h3><p>Per quarter after the market could finally name the difference.</p><span>03 / DEMAND</span></article><article class="pm-receipts__image"><img src="/images/workshop.webp" alt="Conceptual strategic working session" width="1600" height="1000" /><span>Every metric needs a story<br />that survives scrutiny.</span></article></div></section>

  <section class="pm-method"><div class="pm-method__top"><p class="pm-label">The blueprint</p><h2>ONE SYSTEM.<br /><i>FOUR</i> LEVERS.</h2></div><div class="pm-map"><div class="pm-node pm-node--1"><span>01</span><h3>Position</h3><p>The claim you can defend.</p></div><div class="pm-node pm-node--2"><span>02</span><h3>Proof</h3><p>The record you can show.</p></div><div class="pm-node pm-node--3"><span>03</span><h3>Package</h3><p>The method people can repeat.</p></div><div class="pm-node pm-node--4"><span>04</span><h3>Platform</h3><p>The rooms that need to know.</p></div><div class="pm-map__core">THE<br />RECORD</div></div></section>

  <section class="pm-case"><div class="pm-case__header"><p class="pm-label">Case story / 01</p><span>THE CLIENT DID NOT NEED MORE VISIBILITY. THEY NEEDED THE RIGHT INTERPRETATION OF THE WORK.</span></div><h2>FROM INVISIBLE<br />OPERATOR TO<br /><i>CATEGORY</i><br />REFERENCE.</h2><div class="pm-case__footer"><p>A deep case study should show the initial condition, the intervention, and the permissioned evidence—never just the most flattering outcome.</p><a href="/case-studies/">Open the case-study system ↗</a></div></section>

  <section class="pm-cta"><p class="pm-label">A direct question</p><h2>What is already<br />true—but hard<br />to see?</h2><a href="/contact/">Find the evidence gap ↗</a></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(.direction--proof) { --pm-blue:#0b32a8; background:#f1f1eb; color:#101114; } :global(.direction--proof .announcement-bar) { display:none; } :global(.direction--proof .site-header) { background:#f1f1eb; color:#101114; border-bottom:1px solid #101114; } :global(.direction--proof .site-header a) { color:#101114; } :global(.direction--proof .site-footer) { background:#101114; }
  .pm-nav { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; padding:1.1rem clamp(1.25rem,3.5vw,4rem); border-bottom:1px solid #101114; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.63rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; } .pm-nav span { color:#525355; } .pm-nav a:last-child { color:var(--pm-blue); }
  .pm-hero { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr; min-height:calc(100svh - 8.5rem); overflow:hidden; border-bottom:1px solid #101114; } .pm-hero__copy { position:relative; z-index:1; padding:clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem) clamp(1.25rem,5vw,6.5rem); } .pm-label { margin:0; color:var(--pm-blue); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.65rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.15em; text-transform:uppercase; } .pm-hero h1, .pm-receipts h2, .pm-method h2, .pm-case h2, .pm-cta h2 { margin:1.3rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(4.2rem,10vw,11.5rem); font-weight:800; line-height:.74; letter-spacing:-.09em; } .pm-hero h1 span { color:var(--pm-blue); } .pm-hero h1 i,.pm-method h2 i,.pm-case h2 i { color:var(--pm-blue); font-family:var(--font-serif); font-weight:400; } .pm-hero__copy > p:not(.pm-label) { max-width:29rem; margin:2.5rem 0 0; color:#4f5154; font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.65; } .pm-hero__copy > a, .pm-case a, .pm-cta a { display:inline-block; margin-top:2.2rem; padding:.85rem 1rem; background:var(--pm-blue); color:#fff; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.66rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase; } .pm-hero__copy > a b { padding-left:1rem; font-size:1rem; } .pm-hero__photo { position:relative; min-height:35rem; background:#c8c8be; overflow:hidden; } .pm-hero__photo img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; filter:saturate(.76) contrast(1.1); } .pm-hero__photo::after { position:absolute; inset:0; content:''; background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(11,50,168,.55),transparent 46%); mix-blend-mode:multiply; } .pm-photo-note { position:absolute; z-index:1; left:2rem; bottom:2rem; color:#fff; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.65rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; line-height:1.5; text-transform:uppercase; } .pm-side { position:absolute; z-index:3; top:50%; left:50%; transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(90deg); color:#f1f1eb; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.62rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.25em; line-height:1.1; text-align:center; text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4); }
  .pm-receipts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1.55fr; gap:clamp(2rem,8vw,10rem); padding:clamp(6rem,12vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,5vw,6.5rem); } .pm-receipts h2 { max-width:8ch; font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5.8vw,6.8rem); line-height:.84; } .pm-receipts__intro > p:last-child { max-width:28rem; margin:2rem 0 0; color:#56585a; line-height:1.7; } .pm-receipts__grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1px; background:#101114; border:1px solid #101114; } .pm-receipts__grid article { display:flex; min-height:15rem; flex-direction:column; justify-content:flex-end; padding:1.5rem; background:#f1f1eb; } .pm-receipts__grid b { color:var(--pm-blue); font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,5.5rem); line-height:.8; letter-spacing:-.08em; } .pm-receipts__grid h3 { margin:1.3rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.15rem; } .pm-receipts__grid p { margin:.55rem 0 0; color:#515356; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.55; } .pm-receipts__grid span { margin-top:1.7rem; color:#747678; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; } .pm-receipts__grid .pm-receipts__image { position:relative; grid-column:span 2; min-height:18rem; padding:0; background:#101114; } .pm-receipts__image img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; opacity:.7; filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.2); } .pm-receipts__image span { position:absolute; left:1.5rem; bottom:1.5rem; max-width:15rem; color:#fff; font-size:.72rem; line-height:1.5; text-transform:uppercase; }
  .pm-method { padding:clamp(6rem,12vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,5vw,6.5rem); background:var(--pm-blue); color:#f1f1eb; } .pm-method .pm-label { color:#a7bcff; } .pm-method h2 { font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,8.5rem); } .pm-method h2 i { color:#f1f1eb; } .pm-map { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1px; max-width:70rem; margin:clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem) auto 0; border:1px solid rgba(241,241,235,.4); background:rgba(241,241,235,.4); } .pm-node { min-height:15rem; padding:1.5rem; background:var(--pm-blue); } .pm-node span { color:#a7bcff; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.7rem; font-weight:800; } .pm-node h3 { margin:3.5rem 0 0; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.7rem; letter-spacing:-.05em; } .pm-node p { margin:.5rem 0 0; color:#c7d2ff; } .pm-map__core { position:absolute; top:50%; left:50%; display:grid; place-items:center; width:9rem; height:9rem; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); border:1px solid #f1f1eb; border-radius:50%; background:#101114; color:#f1f1eb; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; line-height:1.4; text-align:center; }
  .pm-case { padding:clamp(6rem,12vw,11rem) clamp(1.25rem,5vw,6.5rem); background:#f1f1eb; } .pm-case__header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:2rem; } .pm-case__header span { max-width:20rem; color:#515356; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:.6rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; line-height:1.5; text-transform:uppercase; } .pm-case h2 { max-width:11ch; font-size:clamp(3.3rem,8.7vw,10rem); } .pm-case__footer { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; gap:2rem; margin-top:clamp(4rem,8vw,8rem); padding-top:1.5rem; border-top:1px solid #101114; } .pm-case__footer p { max-width:31rem; margin:0; color:#515356; line-height:1.7; } .pm-case a { margin:0; white-space:nowrap; }
  .pm-cta { padding:clamp(6rem,12vw,12rem) clamp(1.25rem,5vw,6.5rem); background:#101114; color:#f1f1eb; } .pm-cta .pm-label { color:#d2daff; } .pm-cta h2 { max-width:11ch; font-size:clamp(3rem,7.5vw,8.5rem); } .pm-cta a { background:#f1f1eb; color:#101114; }
  @media (max-width:740px) { .pm-nav span { display:none; } .pm-hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .pm-hero__photo { min-height:24rem; order:-1; } .pm-hero__copy { padding-top:3rem; } .pm-side { display:none; } .pm-receipts { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .pm-case__header,.pm-case__footer { display:grid; } .pm-case a { justify-self:start; } }
</style>
